      "content": "it's not just the fatigue though. it's the realization that it's all so pointless. i look at these people and i just see the decay. the struggle itself feels like the problem... like the only way to actually find any peace is to just stop trying to fight the tide. to just let it happen. does that even make sense? to just want the noise to stop?",
